          "snippet": {
            "line": 48,
            "text": "def axialPrimitive (h η : ℝ) (W U M Mη S Sη P Pη : ℝ → ℝ) (x : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  -(x * W x * U x) + axialExponent h * (M x - η * Mη x) +\n    4 * h * η * S x - coordinateFactor η * Sη x +\n    x * (4 * velocityExponent h * η * P x - coordinateFactor η * Pη x)"
          }
